		"&e• Elegant cutting arcs with near-zero recovery delay.&r"
		"&7Fast, stylish, and unforgiving in momentum."
	]
	quest.2001000000000004.quest_subtitle: "Fluid arc slashes with rapid recovery."
	quest.2001000000000004.title: "&eKatana — Arc of the Swift&r"
	quest.2001000000000005.quest_desc: [
