		"&7Stay on the move and overwhelm targets with speed."
	]
	quest.2001000000000005.quest_subtitle: "Mobile sprint combos for aggressive duelists."
	quest.2001000000000005.title: "&eBackhand Blade — Reverse Grip&r"
	quest.2001000000000006.quest_desc: [
		"&e• Twin crescent daggers designed for vicious close-quarters infighting.&r"
		"&7Double the blades, double the cuts."
	]
	quest.2001000000000006.quest_subtitle: "Dual lunar blades for close-quarters shredding."
	quest.2001000000000006.title: "&eDeerhorns — Crescent Cleavers&r"
	quest.2001000000000007.quest_desc: [
		"&6• The undisputed benchmark of melee combat.&r"
		"&7Flawless balance between cutting sweep, frontal reach, and reliable damage."
	]
	quest.2001000000000007.quest_subtitle: "The perfect balance of sweep, reach, and damage."
	quest.2001000000000007.title: "&6Longsword — The Gold Standard&r"
	quest.2001000000000008.quest_desc: [
		"&6• Curved saber with exceptional kinetic knockback control.&r"
