		"&6&lWelcome to the Heart of Homestead Cooking!&r"
		""
		"Featuring the wholesome harvest recipes of &eFarmer's Delight&r and &aVeggies Delight&r."
		"Divided into 4 cozy culinary wings around the hearth:"
		""
		"&a🥬 North-West:&r The Vegetable Patch and Farm Pantry"
		"&c🥩 North-East:&r The Butcher's Block and Sizzling Skillets"
		"&e🍲 South-West:&r The Village Tavern Kitchen (Stews and Pastas)"
		"&d🥧 South-East:&r The Country Bakery and Orchard Cellar"
		""
		"&6Tip:&r &oEating diverse meals permanently increases your maximum health!&r"
	]
