		"&a&lHome-Grown Goodness.&r"
		""
		"Before you cook a gourmet feast, you have to get your hands dirty in the soil."
		"Harvest fresh veggies, slice cabbages, and knead fresh dough on the board."
		""
		"&6Critic's Note:&r &oRotten tomatoes are not for eating. Use them for villager criticism.&r"
