	quest.5101000000000801.title: "&a🥬 The Vegetable Patch and Pantry&r"
	quest.5101000000000802.quest_desc: [
		"&c&lThe Carnivore's Sanctuary.&r"
		""
		"Grab your heavy cleaver and heat up the cast iron skillet."
		"From prime marbled sirloin and smoked pork bellies to delicate river salmon."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r &oSearing meat on a skillet creates delicious pan juices for gravies!&r"
