		"&d&lThe Sweet Aroma of Golden Pastry.&r"
		""
		"Step into the warm bakery where butter, cinnamon, and fresh orchard fruit fill the air."
		"Cut a generous slice of apple pie, grab a hot cocoa, or pop a sweet berry cheesecake."
		""
		"&6Baker's Tip:&r &oA slice of warm pie with apple cider cures all worldly troubles.&r"
	]
	quest.5101000000000804.quest_subtitle: "Warm pies cooling on the windowsill, fudgy brownies, and pressed juices."
