		"and bakery dessert from &eFarmer's Delight&r and &aVeggies Delight&r."
		""
		"&5Your body has absorbed unprecedented dietary diversity.&r"
		"&6Enjoy your Grandmaster Feast Hamper and Netherite Chef's Knife!&r"
	]
